+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+"""Thai (th) priority-content translation source table.
+
+Scope: **Thai only.**  Nothing in this module is read by any other locale.
+The existing ``data_priority_*.py`` tables carry one 3-tuple per locale
+(``name, shortName, description``) and the builder therefore publishes only
+those three fields.  Every deeper learner-facing field listed in the
+assignment (Paṭiccasamuppāda four aspects, ``paccayaDhamma`` /
+``paccayuppanna`` / ``subdivisions``, vīthi process context and step text)
+is authored here, keyed by the canonical id, so that the integrator can wire
+it with one locale-guarded merge (see ``l10n_work/th/build_hook.diff``).
+
+Schema
+------
+``PACCAYAS[id] = {"paccayaDhamma", "paccayuppanna", "subdivisions",
+                  "examples", "doctrinalNote"}``
+    ``subdivisions`` is ``{paliKey: {"name", "note"}}`` in the order used by
+    ``assets/data/paccayas.json``.
+``PATICCAS[id] = {"characteristic", "function", "manifestation",
+                  "proximateCause", "doctrinalNote", "examples"}``
+``VITHIS[id]   = {"arisingCondition", "significance", "doctrinalNote",
+                  "steps": {stepNumber(str): {"name", "description",
+                                             "doctrinalNote"}}}``
+``CORRECTIONS[section][id] = {field: value}``
+    High-confidence repairs of existing Thai entries that contradict the
+    canonical Pāḷi designation shipped in ``content_en.json`` (Pāḷi is the
+    cross-language anchor).  Each entry is justified in
+    ``l10n_work/th/TERMINOLOGY_EVIDENCE_LEDGER.md``.
+
+Fields absent from ``content_en.json`` are absent here as well: a field the
+English source does not contain is never invented.
+
+Translator: Thai Theravāda Abhidhamma draft, 2026-10-08.  Register:
+อภิธรรมโชติกะ / อภิธัมมัตถสังคหะ teaching Thai.  Status: **draft**, not
+reviewed; every term is listed with its Thai source evidence in
+``l10n_work/th/TERMINOLOGY_EVIDENCE_LEDGER.md``.
+"""
+
